# Custom worker packages to install into the agent at container start.
# Copy to workers.txt and set INSTALL_WORKERS_PATH=/opt/orb/workers.txt in
# collector.env to activate.
#
# Paths are resolved relative to this file. PyPI names, local folders and
# tarballs all work. Pin versions — these run unsandboxed inside the agent.
./worker-example
